### Page 3 of 3

```text
Section 16 on page 11 of this development agreement concerns land for a future fire station in
Swan Ranch. It gives the City an exclusive five-year option to buy the 3.1-acre lot at West
Wallick & Clear Creek for fair market value and states that if the grant application for a pump
station is successful, the developer will donate this lot to the City. If donated, the value of the
land will be credited toward any future fire station impact fees that may be established by the
City that may be assessed against the developer. Since the fire station would still need to be built,
equipped, and staffed, a study on impact fees for the City is still recommended.
Staff recommends adoption of the attached resolution.
```
